---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read Wugweb's privacy policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect information across our website and services.">
  <section class="wrap legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Updated on November 04, 2025</p>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>What is this Privacy Policy for?</h2>
      <p>
        This privacy policy is for this website & being served by Wugweb (including its global
        affiliates) and governs the privacy of its users who choose to use it. This website and
        its owners take a proactive approach to user privacy and ensure the necessary steps are
        taken to protect the privacy of its users throughout their visiting experience.
      </p>
      <p>
        The policy sets out the different areas where user privacy is concerned and outlines the
        obligations & requirements of the users, the website and the website owners. Furthermore,
        regarding how this website processes, stores and protects, we will also enumerate user
        data and information within this policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        By accessing or using our website, you expressly consent to our collection, use and
        disclosure of your personal information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect, store and use the following kinds of personal/non-personal information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Information that you provide to register with us for availing our services attending
          our company's event, subscribing to a newsletter or for submission of an employment
          application in response to a job posting on our website or any other website or social
          media platform;
        </li>
        <li>
          Information about your computer and your visits to and use of this website (including
          your IP address, geographical location, browser type and version, operating system type
          and version, referral source, length of visit, page views, website navigation paths and
          service usage);
        </li>
        <li>Information that you send to us to obtain a quotation/offer/proposal for our services;</li>
        <li>Information that you provide to us to subscribe to our website email notifications; and</li>
        <li>Any other information that you voluntarily choose to send to us.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Usage of Information We Gather</h2>
      <p>
        We require this information to understand your needs and expectations and provide you
        with a better service, and in particular for the following reasons: to help us develop,
        customise, deliver, support and improve our services; for our internal purposes (such as
        auditing, data analysis, and research to improve our services and communications). When
        you enter your contact information or send an email or other communication to Wugweb, we
        may retain those communications to process your inquiries and respond to your requests.
        We may periodically send promotional emails about our achievements, special offers or any
        other information we think you may find interesting using the email address you provided.
        From time to time, we may also use your information to contact you for market research
        purposes. We may contact you by email, phone or fax. Any information gathered by us may
        be shared, if appropriate, with any Wugweb offices, affiliates and subsidiaries
        worldwide. We may use our provided information to customise the website according to your
        interests.
      </p>
      <p>
        Wugweb may share some or all of your personal information with another business entity
        should we plan to reorganise, spin out, merge with, acquire, or be acquired by that
        business entity. Should such an event occur, we will require the new or combined entity to
        follow this Privacy Policy concerning your personal information.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is possible that we might be forced to disclose your personally identifiable
        information in response to a legal process or when we believe in good faith such
        disclosure is required by law, such as in response to a court order, a law enforcement
        agency request, in response to a subpoena, or response to an administrative agency's
        request.
      </p>
      <p>
        Although we employ security measures to prevent unauthorised access to the information we
        collect online, we cannot guarantee the security of your personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>Information Security</h2>
      <p>
        Wugweb strives to protect your personal information. To prevent un-authorised access or
        disclosure, we have put in place suitable physical, electronic and managerial procedures
        to safeguard and secure the information we collect online. We also make commercially
        reasonable efforts to ensure the security of your information. Unfortunately, no data
        transmission over the internet can be guaranteed to be 100% secure.
      </p>

      <h2>International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Information we collect may be stored and processed in and transferred between any of the
        countries in which we operate to enable us to use the information per this privacy
        policy. The information you provide may be transferred to countries with different data
        protection laws or do not have data protection laws. By using our Website, you consent to
        such transfer of information.
      </p>

      <h2>External Links</h2>
      <p>
        Although this website only looks to include quality, safe and relevant external links, if
        required, users are advised to adopt a policy of caution before clicking any external
        links mentioned on this website. (External links are clickable text/banner/image links,
        etc.)
      </p>
      <p>
        The owners of this website cannot guarantee or verify the contents of any externally
        linked website despite their best efforts. Users should therefore note they click on
        external links at their own risk. This website and its owners cannot be held liable for
        any damages or implications caused by visiting any external links.
      </p>

      <h2>Social Media Platforms</h2>
      <p>
        This website may use social sharing buttons that help share web content directly from web
        pages to the social media platform. Users are advised to think before using such social
        sharing buttons at their discretion, noting that the social media platform may track and
        save your request to share a web page through your social media platform account.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website and its owners may share links to relevant web pages. Users are advised to
        take caution and good judgement before clicking any shortened URLs published by this
        website and its owners on social media platforms. Despite the best efforts to ensure only
        genuine URLs are published, many social media platforms are prone to spam and hacking.
        Therefore, this website and its owners cannot be held liable for damages or implications
        caused by visiting shortened links.
      </p>

      <h2>Control your Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        You may choose to restrict the collection or use of your personal information by writing
        to or emailing us at <a href="mailto:hello@wugweb.com">hello@wugweb.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We will not sell, distribute or lease your personal information to third parties unless we
        have your permission or are required by law. We may use your personal information to send
        you promotional information about Wugweb.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you believe that any information we are holding on you is incorrect or incomplete,
        please write to or email us as soon as possible at the above address. We will promptly
        correct any information found to be incorrect.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-block: 6rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-block: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
  }
  .updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .legal-body {
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .legal-body p,
  .legal-body li {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--accent-warm);
  }
</style>
